{
  "TIT.1": {
    "id": "TIT.1",
    "number": "1",
    "bookId": "TIT",
    "reference": "Titus 1",
    "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
    "verseCount": 16,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "1",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "TIT 1"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "1",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Paul, a servant of God, and an apostle of Jesus Christ, according to the faith of God's elect, and the acknowledging of the truth which is after godliness;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "In hope of eternal life, which God, that cannot lie, promised before the world began;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "But hath in due times manifested his word through preaching, which is committed unto me according to the commandment of God our Saviour;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "To Titus,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "mine",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.4"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "own son after the common faith: Grace, mercy,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "and",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.4"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "peace, from God the Father and the Lord Jesus Christ our Saviour.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.4"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For this cause left I thee in Crete, that thou shouldest set in order the things that are wanting, and ordain elders in every city, as I had appointed thee:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "If any be blameless, the husband of one wife, having faithful children not accused of riot or unruly.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For a bishop must be blameless, as the steward of God; not selfwilled, not soon angry, not given to wine, no striker, not given to filthy lucre;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "But a lover of hospitality, a lover of good men, sober, just, holy, temperate;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Holding fast the faithful word as he hath been taught, that he may be able by sound doctrine both to exhort and to convince the gainsayers.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For there are many unruly and vain talkers and deceivers, specially they of the circumcision:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Whose mouths must be stopped, who subvert whole houses, teaching things which they ought not, for filthy lucre's sake.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "One of themselves,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "even",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.12"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "a prophet of their own, said, The Cretians",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "are",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.12",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.12"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "alway liars, evil beasts, slow bellies.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "This witness is true. Wherefore rebuke them sharply, that they may be sound in the faith;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Not giving heed to Jewish fables, and commandments of men, that turn from the truth.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Unto the pure all things",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "are",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.15"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "pure: but unto them that are defiled and unbelieving",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "is",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.15"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "nothing pure; but even their mind and conscience is defiled.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "16",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 1:16"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "16",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "They profess that they know God; but in works they deny",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.16"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "him",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.1.16",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.1.16"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": ", being abominable, and disobedient, and unto every good work reprobate.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.1.16",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.1.16"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "id": "TIT.2",
      "number": "2",
      "bookId": "TIT"
    },
    "previous": {
      "id": "TIT.intro",
      "number": "intro",
      "bookId": "TIT"
    }
  },
  "TIT.2": {
    "id": "TIT.2",
    "number": "2",
    "bookId": "TIT",
    "reference": "Titus 2",
    "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
    "verseCount": 15,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "2",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "TIT 2"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "2",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "But speak thou the things which become sound doctrine:",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "That the aged men be sober, grave, temperate, sound in faith, in charity, in patience.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "The aged women likewise, that",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "they be",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.3"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "in behaviour as becometh holiness, not false accusers, not given to much wine, teachers of good things;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "That they may teach the young women to be sober, to love their husbands, to love their children,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "To be",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.5",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.5"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "discreet, chaste, keepers at home, good, obedient to their own husbands, that the word of God be not blasphemed.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Young men likewise exhort to be sober minded.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "In all things shewing thyself a pattern of good works: in doctrine",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "shewing",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.7"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "uncorruptness, gravity, sincerity,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Sound speech, that cannot be condemned; that he that is of the contrary part may be ashamed, having no evil thing to say of you.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "Exhort",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.9"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "servants to be obedient unto their own masters,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "and",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.9"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "to please",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "them",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.9"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "well in all",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "things",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.2.9"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "; not answering again;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Not purloining, but shewing all good fidelity; that they may adorn the doctrine of God our Saviour in all things.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For the grace of God that bringeth salvation hath appeared to all men,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.11"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Teaching us that, denying ungodliness and worldly lusts, we should live soberly, righteously, and godly, in this present world;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Looking for that blessed hope, and the glorious appearing of the great God and our Saviour Jesus Christ;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Who gave himself for us, that he might redeem us from all iniquity, and purify unto himself a peculiar people, zealous of good works.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 2:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "These things speak, and exhort, and rebuke with all authority. Let no man despise thee.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.2.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.2.15"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "id": "TIT.3",
      "number": "3",
      "bookId": "TIT"
    },
    "previous": {
      "id": "TIT.1",
      "number": "1",
      "bookId": "TIT"
    }
  },
  "TIT.3": {
    "id": "TIT.3",
    "number": "3",
    "bookId": "TIT",
    "reference": "Titus 3",
    "copyright": "PUBLIC DOMAIN except in the United Kingdom, where a Crown Copyright applies to printing the KJV. See http://www.cambridge.org/about-us/who-we-are/queens-printers-patent",
    "verseCount": 15,
    "content": [
      {
        "name": "chapter",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "number": "3",
          "style": "c",
          "sid": "TIT 3"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "text": "3",
            "type": "text"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "1",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:1"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "1",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Put them in mind to be subject to principalities and powers, to obey magistrates, to be ready to every good work,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.1",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.1"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "2",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:2"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "2",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "To speak evil of no man, to be no brawlers,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "but",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.3.2",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.3.2"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "gentle, shewing all meekness unto all men.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.2",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.2"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "3",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:3"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "3",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "For we ourselves also were sometimes foolish, disobedient, deceived, serving divers lusts and pleasures, living in malice and envy, hateful,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "and",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.3.3",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.3.3"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "hating one another.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.3",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.3"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "4",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:4"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "4",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "But after that the kindness and love of God our Saviour toward man appeared,",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.4",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.4"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "5",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:5"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "5",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Not by works of righteousness which we have done, but according to his mercy he saved us, by the washing of regeneration, and renewing of the Holy Ghost;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.5",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.5"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "6",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:6"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "6",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Which he shed on us abundantly through Jesus Christ our Saviour;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.6",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.6"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "7",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:7"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "7",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "That being justified by his grace, we should be made heirs according to the hope of eternal life.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.7",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.7"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "8",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:8"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "8",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "This is",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.3.8",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.3.8"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "a faithful saying, and these things I will that thou affirm constantly, that they which have believed in God might be careful to maintain good works. These things are good and profitable unto men.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.8",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.8"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "9",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:9"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "9",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "But avoid foolish questions, and genealogies, and contentions, and strivings about the law; for they are unprofitable and vain.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.9",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.9"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "10",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:10"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "10",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "A man that is an heretick after the first and second admonition reject;",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.10",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.10"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "11",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:11"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "11",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Knowing that he that is such is subverted, and sinneth, being condemned of himself.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.11",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.11"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "para",
        "type": "tag",
        "attrs": {
          "style": "p"
        },
        "items": [
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "12",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:12"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "12",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "When I shall send Artemas unto thee, or Tychicus, be diligent to come unto me to Nicopolis: for I have determined there to winter.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.12",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.12"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "13",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:13"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "13",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "Bring Zenas the lawyer and Apollos on their journey diligently, that nothing be wanting unto them.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.13",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.13"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "14",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:14"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "14",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "And let ours also learn to maintain good works for necessary uses, that they be not unfruitful.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.14",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.14"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "verse",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "number": "15",
              "style": "v",
              "sid": "TIT 3:15"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "15",
                "type": "text"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "All that are with me salute thee. Greet them that love us in the faith. Grace",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.15"
              ]
            }
          },
          {
            "name": "char",
            "type": "tag",
            "attrs": {
              "style": "add"
            },
            "items": [
              {
                "text": "be",
                "type": "text",
                "attrs": {
                  "verseId": "TIT.3.15",
                  "verseOrgIds": [
                    "TIT.3.15"
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "text": "with you all. Amen.",
            "type": "text",
            "attrs": {
              "verseId": "TIT.3.15",
              "verseOrgIds": [
                "TIT.3.15"
              ]
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "next": {
      "id": "PHM.intro",
      "number": "intro",
      "bookId": "PHM"
    },
    "previous": {
      "id": "TIT.2",
      "number": "2",
      "bookId": "TIT"
    }
  }
}